{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S08—S12几个短停留段落，Y的左侧叙述偏长，尤其S11，边听边读容易来不及；X的短句和按音乐时点出现的提示更容易及时捕捉。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y最大的优势是把人物的情绪变化、行为动机和前后矛盾连成了一个能听懂的故事：为什么想念，为什么不敢回去，为什么最后决定继续生活，都有清楚的心理过渡。X的音乐感受更细密，尤其对音型、力度、旋律变化和情绪瞬间的捕捉更具体，也有按小节出现的优势，但短语数量较多，部分感受容易变成连续的信息碎片。作为没读过原文的普通观众，我更容易通过Y理解这个人经历了什么、为什么这样想，以及最后发生了怎样的改变。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9fa21768-ab19-4071-b652-12e2c7fd2059", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T141201160131Z", "elapsed_seconds": 54.312, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T14:12:55.480775+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "28164146f25c5c65fac4f1cdfb491932dd0928ce8ea73a3556555c21289c202f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f6